#NEXUS

[ mateus2011a_fig6: Sauropod time tree. Internal labels from the six open rings (Sauropoda, Neosauropoda, Titanosauriformes, Somphospondyli, Titanosauria, Diplodocoidea). Nemegtosaurus is drawn as the sister of the Diplodocoidea ring, on a long branch from the node just below it, and is encoded so. Read by eye at 3-6x. 25 tips, fully resolved; 6 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=25;
    TAXLABELS
        Vulcanodon
        Shunosaurus
        Barapasaurus
        Omeisaurus
        Mamenchisaurus
        Patagosaurus
        Jobaria
        Camarasaurus
